{%- comment -%}
  Figma: Components Atoms / Block / Rating (2173:9207): Rating compact (star, score · count)
  The score and count come from the chosen product's reviews (reviews.rating and reviews.rating_count, filled by Judge.me).
  Without a product or reviews it shows nothing.
  Landing block (private: the underscore keeps it out of every other section; only the Landing columns and tabs list it).
  Top and bottom padding are settings on the Figma Spacing scale (spacing/N = N x 4px), as pt-N / pb-N (Hendrik, 24 Nov).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign rated = block.settings.product
  assign rating_value = rated.metafields.reviews.rating.value.rating
  assign rating_count = rated.metafields.reviews.rating_count.value
-%}
<div class="landing-block min-w-0 pt-{{ block.settings.padding_top }} pb-{{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {%- if rating_value != blank -%}
    {% render 'rating', value: rating_value, count: rating_count, size: 'compact', tone: 'current' %}
  {%- endif -%}
</div>

